"anchor":"langsci167-5eb01af19f"},{"id":"langsci167-78372c58b5","tx":"derinena hikiri'ikana mẽyãpü tawĩmeata'ẽ kukaẽ","sg":["deri-ne-na","hikiri-'ika-na","mẽ-yã-pü","tawĩ-me-a-ta-'ẽ","kuka-ẽ"],"gl":["light-PFV-DS","dark-INTENS-DS","2SG-come-IS","await-2SG-1SG-FUT-IMP","tell-DECL"],"tl":"“So you come get me early morning tomorrow!” the girl said.","anchor":"langsci167-78372c58b5"},{"id":"langsci167-96eb945226","tx":"hepü hukadupɨi hepü xünehepü","sg":["he-pü","hukadupɨi","he-pü","xüne-he-pü"],"gl":["then-SS","alright","then-SS","return-3SG-SS"],"tl":"“OK,” the cousin said and left.","anchor":"langsci167-96eb945226"},{"id":"langsci167-b63f528abc","tx":"hena zune iriane","sg":["he-na","zune","iriane"],"gl":["then-DS","night","middle"],"tl":"Then in the middle of the night …","anchor":"langsci167-b63f528abc"},{"id":"langsci167-b295ef2ae7","tx":"derikanerena mɨitü ɨitüderine","sg":["deri-ka-ne-re-na","mɨitü","ɨitü-deri-ne"],"gl":["day-1SG-PFV-FUT-DS","only","be.different-NMLZ-EMPH"],"tl":"It was going to be dawn soon.","anchor":"langsci167-b295ef2ae7"},{"id":"langsci167-64a1b41e52","tx":"yãi eruera apaixüte","sg":["yã-i","eruera","apa-ixüte"],"gl":["come-NMLZ","fox","say-REP"],"tl":"Fox came, they say.","anchor":"langsci167-64a1b41e52"},{"id":"langsci167-0145daa01b","tx":"eruera yãpü","sg":["eruera","yã-pü"],"gl":["fox","come-SS"],"tl":"Fox came.","anchor":"langsci167-0145daa01b"},{"id":"langsci167-58e7c00e26","tx":"namɨi namɨi kukana hãw heẽ","sg":["namɨi","namɨi","kuka-na","hãw","he-ẽ"],"gl":["cousin","cousin","tell-DS","huh","say-DECL"],"tl":"“Cousin, cousin!” he called. “Yes?” she responded.","anchor":"langsci167-58e7c00e26"},{"id":"langsci167-70c837fdbf","tx":"erünuna hikiriikaiwã hikiriikaẽ","sg":["erünuna","hikiri-ika-iwã","hikiri-ika-ẽ"],"gl":["EXPL","dark-INT-ADMON","dark-INT-DECL"],"tl":"“But damn, it's still dark outside, really dark,” (she replied).","anchor":"langsci167-70c837fdbf"},{"id":"langsci167-775b600101","tx":"tawãxapü kaxatai kukaẽ","sg":["tawã-xa-pü","ka-xa-ta-i","kuka-ẽ"],"gl":["what-1PL-SS","do-1PL-FUT-INT","tell-DECL"],"tl":"“Why do we have to go now?”","anchor":"langsci167-775b600101"},{"id":"langsci167-0d998c0147","tx":"hinaẽ derinedupa kawaẽ","sg":["hina-ẽ","deri-ne-dupa","kawa-ẽ"],"gl":["no-DECL","light-PFV-CONC","be-DECL"],"tl":"“No, dawn is almost here.”","anchor":"langsci167-0d998c0147"},{"id":"langsci167-0edf9c7f85","tx":"kawãte izata'ẽ kapü kadiẽ izaidepeta'ẽ kapü kadiẽ heẽ","sg":["kawãte","iza-ta-'ẽ","ka-pü","kadi-ẽ","iza-idepe-ta-'ẽ","ka-pü","kadi-ẽ","he-ẽ"],"gl":["because","far-REM.FUT-DECL","do-SS","affirm-DECL","far-DIR:garden-REM.FUT-DECL","do-SS","affirm-DECL","say-DECL"],"tl":"“It's because the garden is far away, really far away,” he said.","anchor":"langsci167-0edf9c7f85"},{"id":"langsci167-492f1e7dce","tx":"hena mamaderi hürüwanepü","sg":["he-na","mama-deri","hürü-wa-ne-pü"],"gl":["then-DS","mother-3.POSS","rise-DIR:up-PFV-SS"],"tl":"Then her mother awoke.","anchor":"langsci167-492f1e7dce"},{"id":"langsci167-b4dd3730e0","tx":"hena hikiriikaiwã tãwãmeapü kameazati","sg":["he-na","hikiri-ika-iwã","tãwã-mea-pü","ka-meaza-ti"],"gl":["then-DS","dark-INTENS-ADMON","what-2PL-SS","do-2PL-FUT.INT"],"tl":"“But it's still dark out, why are you going?” she said.","anchor":"langsci167-b4dd3730e0"},{"id":"langsci167-5fd782c919","tx":"izaderineipita'ẽ eyedupa kukadupa","sg":["iza-deri-ne-i-pita-'ẽ","eye-dupa","kuka-dupa"],"gl":["far-light-PFV-NMLZ-PROC-IMP","3PL.OBJ-CONC","tell-CONC"],"tl":"“Let the sun come up first,” she told them, but…","anchor":"langsci167-5fd782c919"},{"id":"langsci167-dcef4cf9c4","tx":"hinaẽ kapü derinedupa kawaẽ eyepü","sg":["hina-ẽ","ka-pü","deri-ne-dupa","kawa-ẽ","eye-pü"],"gl":["no-DECL","do-SS","light-PFV-CONC","be-DECL","3PL.OBJ-SS"],"tl":"“No, it's already dawn,” Fox said to them.","anchor":"langsci167-dcef4cf9c4"},{"id":"langsci167-9ec9750350","tx":"hedupana purikɨi'eneke bubu'he'ĩwã tãwãxeapü warexati kukaẽ","sg":["he-dupana","purikɨi-'ene-ke","bubu-'he-'ĩwã","tãwã-xea-