-'ete"],"gl":["now","live-NMLZ-ALL","go-CLF:close-TR-SS","mound","sit-NMLZ-ALL"],"tl":"Then they arrived at a termite mound where he lives.","anchor":"langsci167-ea2ffa8480"},{"id":"langsci167-c667578942","tx":"hena henuduperüka'ine kapü wãheyada","sg":["he-na","henu-du-pe-rüka-'i-ne","ka-pü","wã-he-yada"],"gl":["then-DS","hole-DIR:in-CLF:round-DIR:around-NMLZ-LOC","do-SS","live-3-REAS"],"tl":"It's of course full of holes where he lives.","anchor":"langsci167-c667578942"},{"id":"langsci167-628b0193ab","tx":"hena hapükemukapü waredurikapaẽ","sg":["he-na","hapü-ke-muka-pü","ware-durika-pa-ẽ"],"gl":["then-DS","hold-3-CLF:eye-SS","go-DIR:inside-TR-DECL"],"tl":"Then he covered their eyes and entered.","anchor":"langsci167-628b0193ab"},{"id":"langsci167-884aef6e23","tx":"waredurikapapü","sg":["ware-durika-pa-pü"],"gl":["go-DIR:inside-TR-SS"],"tl":"They went inside.","anchor":"langsci167-884aef6e23"},{"id":"langsci167-c272cf793b","tx":"hena kɨinezũ keza ɨitühene'ena","sg":["he-na","kɨine-zũ","keza","ɨitü-he-ne'e-na"],"gl":["then-DS","3SG-POSS","house","be.different-3-ITE-DS"],"tl":"His house was very different.","anchor":"langsci167-c272cf793b"},{"id":"langsci167-4661e3ee59","tx":"kawã kayaparehãyãpü kawãtena ãryüakukapederiame hena","sg":["kawã","ka-ya-pa-re-hãyã-pü","kawãte-na","ãryüa-kuka-pe-deri-ame","he-na"],"gl":["be.like","1SG-come-TR-FUT-1PL.OBJ-SS","because-DS","know-CLF:body-CLF:round-NMLZ-SUP","then-DS"],"tl":"“He really is leading us astray,\" the older and somewhat more knowledgeable girl thought.","anchor":"langsci167-4661e3ee59"},{"id":"langsci167-85faac3222","tx":"wãwã'ĩ'ikaderihame kapü hinaĩ hina kukaẽ","sg":["wãwã'ĩ-'ika-deri-hame","ka-pü","hina-ĩ","hina","kuka-ẽ"],"gl":["child-INTENS-NMLZ-SUP","do-SS","no-NMLZ","no","say-DECL"],"tl":"The little child didn't worry at all, didn't say anything.","anchor":"langsci167-85faac3222"},{"id":"langsci167-2b21adacea","tx":"tãwãxeapü kaxa'i erükazapa'ĩ kawã dukumɨi kawãtena","sg":["tãwã-xea-pü","ka-xa-'i","erükazapa'ĩ","kawã","dukumɨi","kawãte-na"],"gl":["what-1PL-SS","do-1PL-INT","wow!","be.like","ruin","because-DS"],"tl":"“How is it that we stopped here? Wow, it must be some spirit messing with us.”","anchor":"langsci167-2b21adacea"},{"id":"langsci167-901e304085","tx":"namɨi kayareapaite'i","sg":["namɨi","ka-ya-re-a-pa-i-te'i"],"gl":["cousin","1SG-come-FUT-1SG.OBJ-TR-NMLZ-EMPH"],"tl":"“I thought it was my cousin!”","anchor":"langsci167-901e304085"},{"id":"langsci167-c4cf6755ee","tx":"he'ẽ kapü ã'apakukaẽ","sg":["he-'ẽ","ka-pü","ã-'a-pa-kuka-ẽ"],"gl":["say-DECL","do-SS","think-3SG.REFL-TR-CLF:body-DECL"],"tl":"She went on thinking and became sad.","anchor":"langsci167-c4cf6755ee"},{"id":"langsci167-3f96ea40b3","tx":"nake tãwã ãanaẽ kapü hina'ĩ'ẽ","sg":["nake","tãwã","ã-a-na-ẽ","ka-pü","hina-'ĩ-'ẽ"],"gl":["COND","what","think-1SG.OBJ-NEG-DECL","do-SS","no-NMLZ-DECL"],"tl":"“What can I do? There is nothing.”","anchor":"langsci167-3f96ea40b3"},{"id":"langsci167-3a7d730243","tx":"hena'ẽ zamiya hiku ise'ideri du<ka>nuẽ hepü yoa","sg":["hena-'ẽ","zamiya","hiku","ise-'i-deri","d-u<ka>nu-ẽ","he-pü","yoa"],"gl":["quiet-IMP","now","other","small-NMLZ-NMLZ","1SG-hungry<1SG>-DECL","say-SS","cry"],"tl":"The little one was crying from hunger.","anchor":"langsci167-3a7d730243"},{"id":"langsci167-e3a92d81b9","tx":"he'ẽ kapü kɨine hiku ti'iweke ũ<ne>nudupa","sg":["he-'ẽ","ka-pü","kɨine","hiku","ti'iwe-ke","ũ<ne>nu-dupa"],"gl":["say-DECL","do-SS","3SG","other","grow-COM","hungry<PFV>-CONC"],"tl":"The grown one also had gotten hungry but (she held on).","anchor":"langsci167-e3a92d81b9"},{"id":"langsci167-4f8a11f7d3","tx":"tãwã'ãnaẽ he'ẽ yoaẽ","sg":["tãwã-'ã-na-ẽ","he-'ẽ","yoa-ẽ"],"gl":["what-IMPERS-NEG-DECL","say-DECL","cry-DECL"],"tl":"“What can one do?” she said. “She is crying.”","anchor":"langsci167-4f8a11f7d3"},{"id":"langsci167-39c6f57842","tx":"eruerazũ mamaderi","sg":["eruera-zũ","mama-deri"],"gl":["fox-POSS","mother-3.POSS"],"tl":"Now Fox's mother (comments):","anchor":"langsci167-39c6f57842"},{"id":"langsci167-29cafe543b","tx":"kawãnunu hãemepe'eyepü kawãte'i kukaẽ","sg":["kawã-nunu","hãe-me-pe-'eye-pü","kawãte-'i","kuka-ẽ"],"gl":["be.like-MIR","grab-2SG-CLF:round-3PL.OBJ-SS","because-INT","say-DECL"],"tl":"“Why the hell did you catch them?” she said to him angrily.","anchor":"langsci167-29cafe543b"},{"id":"langsci167-b2f0a7ae74","tx":"kawayada xoakarüperekaẽ urikɨi hepü hikade'ẽ","sg":["kawa-yada","xoa-ka-rüpe-re-ka-ẽ","urikɨi","he-pü","hika-de-'ẽ"],"gl":["be-REAS","see-1SG-DIR:ground-FUT-1SG-DECL","food","say-SS","leave-DIR:outside-DECL"],"tl":"So he said “I will look for food,” and left.","anchor":"langsci167-b2f0a7ae74"},{"id":"langsci167-c266f3c568","tx":"hikadepü kapü wã'apaderi'ete yü̃'eyeẽ kapü","sg":["hika-de-pü","ka-pü","wã-'apaderi-'ete","yü̃-'eye-ẽ","ka-pü"],"gl":["leave-DIR:outside-SS","do-SS","live-ACT.NMLZ-ALL","DIR:close-3PL.OBJ-DECL","do-SS"],"tl":"He went outside and left for where the girls' parents lived.","anchor":"langsci167-c266f3c568"},{"id":"langsci167-1dad06d857","tx":"tara pu'apaderiye kuraruye kapü","sg":["tara","pu-'apaderi-ye","kuraru-ye","ka-pü"],"gl":["what","raise-ACT.NMLZ-OBJ","chicken-OBJ","do-SS"],"tl":"There he got things that one raises, chickens.","anchor":"langsci167-1dad06d857"},{"id":"langsci167-26901d3871","tx":"düdü pu'apa'iye kikireye hãehãe<ke>pesa'eye","sg":["düdü","pu-'apa'i-ye","kikire-ye","hãe~hãe<ke>pe-sa-'eye"],"gl":["parrot","raise-ACT.NMLZ-OBJ","parakeet-OBJ","grab~grab<3SG>-MAL-3PL.OBJ"],"tl":"Pet parrots, parakeets, he grabbed them from the residents.","anchor":"langsci167-26901d3871"},{"id":"langsci167-63d3a0e79b","tx":"nasunapaẽ wãderi'ete duxüpanepü hiba'eyenakedupa kapü","sg":["na-suna-pa-ẽ","wã-deri-'ete","du-xü-pa-ne-pü","hiba-'eye-nake-dupa","ka-pü"],"gl":["bring-DIR:hither-TR-DECL","live-NMLZ-ALL","DIR:in-DIR:return-TR-PFV-SS","give-3PL.OBJ-COND-CONC","do-SS"],"tl":"He brought those home, and entering into their residence, gave (the food) to the children, however …","anchor":"langsci167-63d3a0e79b"},{"id":"langsci167-f767762cca","tx":"haradukarinake","sg":["hara-dukari-nake"],"gl":["not.want-3PL-COND"],"tl":"They really didn't want anything.","anchor":"langsci167-f767762cca"},{"id":"langsci167-7d8a565a2f","tx":"haradukarinake tãwãanaẽ kapü","sg":["hara-dukari-nake","tãwã-a-na-ẽ","ka-pü"],"gl":["not.want-3PL-COND","what-IMPERS-NEG-DECL","do-SS"],"tl":"“They didn't want anything, now what can one do?”","anchor":"langsci167-7d8a565a2f"},{"id":"langsci167-4dbde70ff5","tx":"yoahedukarina kapü kãwãẽ zamiya mamaderi","sg":["yoa-he-dukari-na","ka-pü","kãwã-ẽ","zamiya","mama-deri"],"gl":["cry-3-3PL-DS","do-SS","be.like-DECL","now","mother-3.POSS"],"tl":"They kept on crying as ever. And then his mother went:","anchor":"langsci167-4dbde70ff5"},{"id":"langsci167-a601046c19","tx":"tara hü'a'iye xoawe'eyepü tãwãmepü urikɨiye kamezai","sg":["tara","hü'a-'i-ye","xoa-we'eye-pü","tãwã-me-pü","urikɨi-ye","ka-meza-i"],"gl":["what","good-NMLZ-OBJ","see-3PL.BEN-SS","what-2SG-SS","food-OBJ","do-2SG.CAUS-INT"],"tl":"“Find them something good, you only bring bad stuff.”","anchor":"langsci167-a601046c19"},{"id":"langsci167-f01351383e","tx":"tara dukumɨi'iye kaw'i kawã'ĩwãwã","sg":["tara","dukumɨi-'i-ye","kaw-'i","kawã-'ĩwã~wã"],"gl":["what","ruin-NMLZ-OBJ","eat-NMLZ","be.like-ADMON~RED"],"tl":"“They don't eat worthless things.”","anchor":"langsci167-f01351383e"},{"id":"langsci167-81bb0d659a","tx":"kawãĩ dukumɨi'iye kawxare'ẽaremina","sg":["kawã-ĩ","dukumɨi-'i-ye","kaw-xa-re-'ẽ-are-mina"],"gl":["be.like-NMLZ","ruin-NMLZ-OBJ","eat-1PL-FUT-IMP-INFR-EMP.NEG"],"tl":"“They don't even think of eating what's worthless.”","anchor":"langsci167-81bb0d659a"},{"id":"langsci167-44f8177025","tx":"hü'anai apadukari'iwa he'ẽ kukana","sg":["hü'a-na-i","apa-dukari-'iwa","he-'ẽ","kuka-na"],"gl":["good-NEG-NMLZ","find-3PL-ADMON","say-DECL","tell-DS"],"tl":"“They are suffering,” she said to him.","anchor":"langsci167-44f8177025"},{"id":"langsci167-ae91784ee2","tx":"iza hepü","sg":["iza","he