c","tx":"hibaye awexüye hukedurakaxüne'ẽ","sg":["hiba-ye","awexü-ye","hu-ke-duraka-xüne-'ẽ"],"gl":["this-OBJ","demon-OBJ","remove-3-DIR:inside-DIR:return-IMP"],"tl":"“Remove this demon from inside of her!”","anchor":"langsci167-f27b07f7dc"},{"id":"langsci167-2e49a550f3","tx":"pawpawkezakaxüne'ẽ kyãkukapü","sg":["paw~paw-keza-ka-xüne-'ẽ","kyã-kuka-pü"],"gl":["run~run-3SG.CAUS-TR-DIR:return-IMP","speak-tell-SS"],"tl":"“Make it (the demon) run away!\" he said to him.","anchor":"langsci167-2e49a550f3"},{"id":"langsci167-b8be2c655a","tx":"derinena zamiya deripanena","sg":["deri-ne-na","zamiya","deri-pa-ne-na"],"gl":["light-PFV-DS","now","light-TR-PFV-DS"],"tl":"Dawn came and then day came.","anchor":"langsci167-b8be2c655a"},{"id":"langsci167-b403562c28","tx":"zamiya kapü kukapü daexünepü","sg":["zamiya","ka-pü","kuka-pü","dae-xüne-pü"],"gl":["now","do-SS","tell-SS","walk-DIR:return-SS"],"tl":"“It's done,\" he said, and (the demon) went back to where he came from.","anchor":"langsci167-b403562c28"},{"id":"langsci167-13a30390ce","tx":"hena wɨiwɨiyeye wãkanayeyepü urikɨiye hürakenupapü","sg":["he-na","wɨiwɨi-yeye","wãkana-yeye-pü","urikɨi-ye","hüra-ke-nupa-pü"],"gl":["then-DS","repeat-ITE","late.morning-ITE-SS","food-OBJ","place-3-DIR:outside-SS"],"tl":"Then it had to be repeated during the day, and food was placed in the yard (for the shaman and the possessed child) .","anchor":"langsci167-13a30390ce"},{"id":"langsci167-c34a84ea7d","tx":"kariye kawhepü","sg":["kari-ye","kaw-he-pü"],"gl":["that-OBJ","eat-3-SS"],"tl":"She ate some of that.","anchor":"langsci167-c34a84ea7d"},{"id":"langsci167-09b209ba1c","tx":"büxühekune'e'ẽ kukapü büxühene'epü xükeakapapü","sg":["büxü-he-ku-ne'e-'ẽ","kuka-pü","büxü-he-ne'e-pü","xü-kea-ka-pa-pü"],"gl":["cure-3-1SG.BEN-ITE-IMP","tell-SS","cure-3-ITE-SS","finish-3SG-CLF:piece-TR-SS"],"tl":"“Perform the cure again for me,” he said, and the shaman did so again, and finished (removing the demon's spirit from the head of the child).","anchor":"langsci167-09b209ba1c"},{"id":"langsci167-9128556675","tx":"taraye kawahenake xükeakapapü","sg":["tara-ye","kaw-a-he-nake","xü-kea-ka-pa-pü"],"gl":["what-OBJ","eat-IMPERS-3-COND","finish-3SG-CLF:piece-TR-SS"],"tl":"Through eating (the food) he could remove the demon's spirit (from the bodies of the girls).","anchor":"langsci167-9128556675"},{"id":"langsci167-cded0894d6","tx":"kapünepü zamiya kapü zamiya hü'akaxünerewaẽ wãwã'ĩ","sg":["kapü-ne-pü","zamiya","ka-pü","zamiya","hü'a-ka-xüne-re-wa-ẽ","wãwã'ĩ"],"gl":["finish-PFV-SS","now","do-SS","now","good-1SG-DIR:return-FUT-2SG.BEN-DECL","child"],"tl":"He finished and said, “Now that it's done, your children will get well again.”","anchor":"langsci167-cded0894d6"},{"id":"langsci167-bb296c0bdd","tx":"zare kaxünerewaẽ","sg":["zare","ka-xüne-re-wa-ẽ"],"gl":["person","1SG-DIR:return-FUT-2SG.BEN-DECL"],"tl":"“They will be people again for you.”","anchor":"langsci167-bb296c0bdd"},{"id":"langsci167-27a5ed0c65","tx":"kuka'i apa'ixüte kukana","sg":["kuka-'i","apa-'ixüte","kuka-na"],"gl":["tell-NMLZ","say-REP","tell-DS"],"tl":"This is how he spoke to the father.","anchor":"langsci167-27a5ed0c65"},{"id":"langsci167-c60a3043aa","tx":"hukadupɨi hepü","sg":["hukadupɨi","he-pü"],"gl":["alright","say-SS"],"tl":"“Alright,” he said.","anchor":"langsci167-c60a3043aa"},{"id":"langsci167-a6b352d920","tx":"wãwã'ĩke hina'ĩ hũka hũka eryüanahe'ẽ hũkakeaderi","sg":["wãwã'ĩ-ke","hina-'ĩ","hũka","hũka","eryüana-he-'ẽ","hũka-kea-deri"],"gl":["child-COM","no-NMLZ","in.vain","in.vain","sick-3-DECL","in.vain-3-NMLZ"],"tl":"The children used to be ill and were really going crazy.","anchor":"langsci167-a6b352d920"},{"id":"langsci167-114cf5ea74","tx":"zamiya zɨ̃izɨ̃i eryüaxünena zamiya","sg":["zamiya","zɨ̃izɨ̃i","eryüa-xüne-na","zamiya"],"gl":["now","correct","live-DIR:return-DS","now"],"tl":"But now they were behaving well again.","anchor":"langsci167-114cf5ea74"},{"id":"langsci167-05a1eecb85","tx":"wãwã'ĩikaderike hepü hü'axüneẽ","sg":["wãwã'ĩ-ika-deri-ke"